      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "So you are pretty much asking for a graphics menu in game. Essentially for the preset options in the quality settings levels to be exposed in an in application video settings menu, rather than being stuck with the presets. \n\nSomething vrchat should have had a long time ago. Unity makes it extremely easy to expose all the quality settings. I am pretty sure this has been requested years ago, as usual.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
