  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-12-13T15:59:47.490Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Every unity project, whether it be a simple game to a game as large as VRChat, has the option in the unity project to change the graphics quality. Other than the simple three option menu that pops up when you hold LeftShift when launching VRChat from Steam, thats pretty much it.\nI'm simply looking for a way to change the graphics quality to something below VRLow as my measly laptop is unable to endure the PC torture that is VRChat and all of its unoptimized  (but amazing) user created content.\nIf there are any command lines for the steam launch options that would work for SteamVR or VRChat that would do something identical to this, please share.",
